flowchart LR
    subgraph Browser[Customer browser — untrusted]
        Host[Dealership website]
        Widget[Web component widget\ncore + views + controller]
        Storage[localStorage\nconversation ID + UI state + ordinary form profile]
        Host --> Widget
        Widget <--> Storage
    end

    subgraph Service[webchat-service — trusted application boundary]
        API[Security middleware + FastAPI routes]
        Orchestrator[Orchestrator\nturn lifecycle + per-conversation lock]
        Context[Context builder\npage snapshots + last 20 messages + workflow state]
        Provider[Provider adapter\nOpenAI/Azure or deterministic fake planner]
        Planning[V2 domain-goal schema + SemanticPlanPolicy + TransitionController]
        Tools[ToolRegistry\ncapability handlers + strict inputs]
        Workflow[WorkflowService\ndrafts + confirmation + receipts]
        Adapter[DealershipClient\npublic reads + protected writes]
        Repositories[Repositories + SQLite\nconversations, turns, messages, workflows]

        API --> Orchestrator
        Orchestrator --> Context
        Context <--> Repositories
        Orchestrator --> Provider
        Provider --> Planning
        Planning --> Tools
        Tools --> Workflow
        Workflow <--> Repositories
        Tools --> Adapter
        Workflow --> Adapter
        Orchestrator --> Repositories
    end

    subgraph External[External authoritative systems]
        AI[OpenAI Responses API\nor Azure OpenAI]
        Platform[Dealership platform\nbusiness source of truth]
    end

    Widget -->|credentialed JSON + HttpOnly cookie| API
    Provider -->|hosted mode only| AI
    Adapter -->|HTTP; API key only for protected operations| Platform
